WHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","review_id":"nrJoLd7saGPjO3rSsL3xXg","date":"2019-07-05T19:02:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.950911283493042,"text_excerpt":"I treated myself to sushi at Haiku for my birthday this year. I've always been curious about Haiku, and I knew it had to be doing something right since it's stayed open in a location with a pretty spotty history of keeping businesses alive. The place was pretty empty at noon on a Monday, and I had no trouble getting a patio table for one. The service was fast, the beer tasted delicious (clean lines are a MUST), and the sushi was great. I am always on the lookout for affordable sushi that doesn't sacrifice quality, and this place really measured up on that rubric. I ordered the White Ninja roll (spicy tuna, cucumber, cilantro, albacore, jalapeno, sriracha, ponzu, wasabi creme) and really e..."},{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","review_id":"yJ69Td1Qj1Ro0l3XAlo23A","date":"2015-11-13T19:04:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9420881271362305,"text_excerpt":"Just ate here and we're STUFFED. $12.50 for a lunch sushi special, which includes a soup or a salad. I opted for the miso. It was quite tasty, lotsa seaweed and tofu. The wasabi was very fresh and spicy!! The sushi and sashimi were very fresh. I noted that it took a little longer for the meals to come, but seemed that it was because the chef was taking his time. The waitress was very attentive (there weren't a lot of people in the place), but not annoying. We were in and out in about 40 minutes. It's so easy for sushi restaurants to \"phone it in\" and get lazy. I know this place is new, but they certainly seem to be paying attention to details and serving very fresh fish. The rolls held to..."},{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","review_id":"lDMRkaKKP8FSosdjz14jmw","date":"2018-07-01T18:20:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9392991065979004,"text_excerpt":"Man this place is putting some AWESOME sushi on the plate! They take super great care of us every time, the fish is fantastic and I personally think it's one of the great hidden values! The five piece sashimi prices are irresistible! Even in the beginning of July their porch dining is pretty cool. All in all I think Haiku is among the best sushi places in town for sure!! If you haven't yet, make sure you do soon!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","photo_id":"_I1iTDfqOhkW3pWqsncM0g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_I1iTDfqOhkW3pWqsncM0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9118940830230713},{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","photo_id":"SeoTsKO9uqXEqhN3pZYz6A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SeoTsKO9uqXEqhN3pZYz6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8805813193321228},{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","photo_id":"bswpg3g41KNYXlbN7poK1Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/bswpg3g41KNYXlbN7poK1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8555617332458496},{"business_id":"xfmXbvTrtmfGxySJQ2TRXQ","photo_id":"wg9oq9xXA5vsPpmp0L374g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/wg9oq9xXA5vsPpmp0L374g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.807896614074707}]},"notebook_case":null}
